# OpenROAD Flow GUI - Intelligence Module
## Project Report for Academic Submission

---

## 1. What is OpenROAD?

### Overview
**OpenROAD** (Open-source RTL-to-GDSII Automatic Design) is an **open-source, end-to-end RTL-to-GDSII automated digital design flow** developed by the OpenROAD Project (UC San Diego, Qualcomm, Google, and other contributors). It automates the complete digital ASIC design flow from RTL (Register Transfer Level) code to final GDSII layout ready for fabrication.

### Core Philosophy
- **Fully Automated**: No human-in-the-loop required for standard flows
- **Open Source**: Apache 2.0 license, community-driven development
- **Modular**: Each stage is a separate tool with well-defined interfaces
- **Technology Agnostic**: Supports multiple PDKs (Process Design Kits)

### Supported Process Design Kits (PDKs)
| PDK | Technology Node | Status |
|-----|----------------|--------|
| **asap7** | 7nm | Production Ready |
| **sky130hd** | 130nm | Production Ready |
| **sky130hs** | 130nm | Production Ready |
| **nangate45** | 45nm | Production Ready |
| **gf12/gf180** | 12nm/180nm | Production Ready |
| **ihp-sg13g2** | 130nm | Production Ready |

---

## 2. OpenROAD Flow Stages (RTL → GDSII)

```
┌─────────────┐    ┌─────────────┐    ┌──────────┐    ┌─────┐    ┌────────┐    ┌────────┐    ┌──────────┐
│  Synthesis  │───▶│  Floorplan  │───▶│  Place   │───▶│ CTS │───▶│ Route  │───▶│ Finish  │───▶│   GDSII  │
│  (Yosys)    │    │  (OpenROAD) │    │ (OpenROAD)│    │     │    │(TritonRoute)│   │(Sign-off)│   │  Output  │
└─────────────┘    └─────────────┘    └──────────┘    └─────┘    └────────┘    └──────────┘    └──────────┘
    Yosys            OpenROAD         OpenROAD          OpenROAD       TritonRoute     OpenROAD          KLayout
  (Logic Synthesis)  (Floorplan/IO)   (Global/Detail)   (Clock Tree)   (Global+Detail)   (Sign-off/STA)    Merge/DRC/LVS
```

### Stage Details

| Stage | Tool | Input | Output | Key Function |
|-------|------|-------|--------|--------------|
| **Synthesis** | Yosys + ABC | RTL (.v), SDC, Liberty | Gate-level netlist (.v), SDC | Logic synthesis, technology mapping, optimization |
| **Floorplan** | OpenROAD | Netlist, SDC, LEF/DEF | Floorplan DEF, PDN | Die/core area, macro placement, power grid, tap cells |
| **Placement** | OpenROAD | Floorplan DEF | Placed DEF | Global placement, detailed placement, timing-driven |
| **CTS** | OpenROAD | Placed DEF | CTS DEF | Clock tree synthesis, buffer insertion, skew balancing |
| **Routing** | TritonRoute | CTS DEF | Routed DEF | Global routing, detailed routing, DRC cleanup |
| **Finish** | OpenROAD | Routed DEF | Final DEF, GDSII | Sign-off STA, IR drop, DRC/LVS, GDSII generation |

