## 4. Machine Learning Pipeline

### 4.1 Data Collection & Feature Engineering
```
ORFS Runs (60+ designs, 5 PDKs)
    → Data Collector (SQLite + JSON reports)
    → Feature Engineering (Polars + 35 features)
    → training_features.parquet (289 rows × 35 features)
```

### 4.2 Feature Set (13 Core Features)
| Category | Features |
|----------|----------|
| **Design** | `log_instances`, `log_nets`, `seq_ratio`, `macro_ratio`, `macro_area_ratio` |
| **Platform** | `platform_cat` (one-hot: asap7, sky130hd, nangate45, gf180, ihp-sg13g2) |
| **Config** | `core_utilization`, `core_aspect_ratio`, `core_margin` |
| **Timing** | `wns_ns`, `tns_ns` (from placement/CTS reports) |
| **Quality** | `congestion_pct`, `drc_violations`, `max_congestion` |
| **Physical** | `area_um2`, `power_mw`, `wirelength`, `via_count` |

### 4.3 Model Performance

| Model | Target | Algorithm | Metric | Value | Status |
|-------|--------|-----------|--------|-------|--------|
| **Failure Predictor** | Timing Closure | LightGBM | AUC | **0.755** | ✅ Production |
| **Failure Predictor** | DRC Clean | LightGBM | AUC | **0.52** | ⚠️ Needs data |
| **Surrogate** | Area | XGBoost | R² | **0.963** | ✅ Excellent |
| **Surrogate** | WNS | XGBoost | R² | 0.287 | ⚠️ Low |
| **Surrogate** | TNS | XGBoost | R² | 0.228 | ⚠️ Low |
| **Surrogate** | Power | LightGBM | R² | 0.479 | ⚠️ Moderate |
| **Flow Optimizer** | PPA Optimization | PPO (PyTorch) | - | Architecture Ready | 🚧 In Progress |

